OL,5,G0848 Witness History
OL,6,     FIn 1963, a big sculpture of a
OL,7,     FScotsman appeared outside a motel.
OL,8,     FA banana, a koala, and even a
OL,9,     Fpotato followed, paving the way
OL,10,     Ffor one of the country's quirkiest
OL,11,     Fphenomena.
OL,12,G0858 Tweet of the Day
OL,13,     FTweet of the Day is a series of
OL,14,     Ffascinating stories about birds
OL,15,     Finspired by their calls, songs and
OL,16,     Fbehaviour.
